{"content":[{"c":["CORNER GATE"],"sourceClass":"h1","t":"p"},{"c":["Gate presumably located in the northwest corner of the Jerusalem wall. After King Jehoash of Israel captured King Amaziah of Judah, he tore down a section of the Jerusalem wall from the Corner Gate to the Ephraim Gate (",{"href":"?bref=2Kgs.14.13","r":"2Kgs.14.13","rawR":"2Kgs.14.13","sourceRefs":[{"raw":"2Kgs.14.13","value":"2Kgs.14.13"}],"t":"ref","v":"2 Kgs 14:13"},"; ",{"href":"?bref=2Chr.25.23","r":"2Chr.25.23","rawR":"2Chr.25.23","sourceRefs":[{"raw":"2Chr.25.23","value":"2Chr.25.23"}],"t":"ref","v":"2 Chr 25:23"},"); later King Uzziah of Judah built towers at this gate (",{"href":"?bref=2Chr.26.9","r":"2Chr.26.9","rawR":"2Chr.26.9","sourceRefs":[{"raw":"2Chr.26.9","value":"2Chr.26.9"}],"t":"ref","v":"2 Chr 26:9"},"). Jeremiah (",{"href":"?bref=Jer.31.38","r":"Jer.31.38","rawR":"Jer.31.38","sourceRefs":[{"raw":"Jer.31.38","value":"Jer.31.38"}],"t":"ref","v":"Jer 31:38"},") foretells a time when the Jerusalem wall will be rebuilt from the Tower of Hananel to the Corner Gate. Zechariah (",{"href":"?bref=Zech.14.10","r":"Zech.14.10","rawR":"Zech.14.10","sourceRefs":[{"raw":"Zech.14.10","value":"Zech.14.10"}],"t":"ref","v":"Zec 14:10"},") also envisions a period of security and prosperity epitomized by the presence of the Jerusalem wall, including the Corner Gate."],"sourceClass":"fl","t":"p"},{"c":[{"c":["See also"],"sourceClass":"ital","t":"span"}," ",{"href":"?item=Jerusalem_Article_TyndaleOpenBibleDictionary","id":"Jerusalem_Article_TyndaleOpenBibleDictionary","rawId":"Jerusalem_Article_TyndaleOpenBibleDictionary","t":"link","v":"Jerusalem"},"."],"sourceClass":"","t":"p"}],"format":"bsb-study-dictionary-v2","id":"CornerGate","provenance":{"archiveSha256":"10758ea00dbea7540f9337e43e59c8e4000295c1261e3426bab6f31c31dcff5b","release":"1.6","sourceCitationReferences":[{"anchorText":"2 Kgs 14:13","canonicalization":"deferred_to_dictionary_mapping_workstream","hrefExact":"?bref=2Kgs.14.13","rawQueryValue":"2Kgs.14.13","sourceRefExact":"2Kgs.14.13"},{"anchorText":"2 Chr 25:23","canonicalization":"deferred_to_dictionary_mapping_workstream","hrefExact":"?bref=2Chr.25.23","rawQueryValue":"2Chr.25.23","sourceRefExact":"2Chr.25.23"},{"anchorText":"2 Chr 26:9","canonicalization":"deferred_to_dictionary_mapping_workstream","hrefExact":"?bref=2Chr.26.9","rawQueryValue":"2Chr.26.9","sourceRefExact":"2Chr.26.9"},{"anchorText":"Jer 31:38","canonicalization":"deferred_to_dictionary_mapping_workstream","hrefExact":"?bref=Jer.31.38","rawQueryValue":"Jer.31.38","sourceRefExact":"Jer.31.38"},{"anchorText":"Zec 14:10","canonicalization":"deferred_to_dictionary_mapping_workstream","hrefExact":"?bref=Zech.14.10","rawQueryValue":"Zech.14.10","sourceRefExact":"Zech.14.10"}],"sourceItemFragmentSha256":"a0244084b042e545f68c0d12b6d5cb9e90fd96a7722f9cc55924f5b79bc55e62","sourceItemName":"CornerGate","sourceItemOrder":284,"sourceMember":"Articles/C.xml","supplementPointersNotIncludedAsContent":[]},"sourceAttributes":{"name":"CornerGate","product":"TyndaleOpenBibleDictionary","typename":"Article"},"sourceTitleExact":"Corner Gate","title":"Corner Gate","version":"v2-a101d843a2f0cd3fc0c6"}